#. ~ Description for {'str': '.22 FMJ'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".22 Long Rifle ammunition with 30gr FMJ bullets.  The .22LR round is "
"extremely weak with very low stopping power, short range, and negligible "
"recoil.  It is most useful for rifle training, and hunting small animals."
msgstr ""
"Es munición .22 Long Rifle con balas FMJ de 30gr. El cartucho .22LR es "
"extremadamente débil y de poca potencia de detención, corto alcance y "
"retroceso insignificante. Su mayor utilidad es en entrenamiento de rifles o "
"caza de pequeños animales."

#. ~ Description for {'str': '.22 LR'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".22 Long Rifle ammunition with 40gr unjacketed bullets.  The .22LR round is "
"extremely weak with very low stopping power, short range, and negligible "
"recoil.  It is most useful for rifle training, and hunting small animals."
msgstr ""
"Es munición .22 Long Rifle con balas sin recubrir de 40gr. El cartucho .22LR "
"es extremadamente débil y de poca potencia de detención, corto alcance, y "
"retroceso insignificante. Su mayor utilidad es en entrenamiento de rifles o "
"caza de pequeños animales."

