#. ~ Description for {'str': '.45 ACP JHP'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".45 ACP ammunition with 185gr JHP bullets.  The .45 ACP round was developed "
"to replace the .38 Long Colt cartridge in the early 20th century.  It has "
"good stopping power but above average recoil."
msgstr ""
"Es munición .45 ACP JHP de 185gr. La bala .45 ACP fue desarrollada para "
"reemplazar la .38 Long Colt a principios del siglo XX. Posee buena potencia "
"de detención pero un retroceso por arriba del promedio."

#. ~ Description for {'str': '.45 ACP FMJ'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".45 ACP ammunition with 230gr FMJ bullets.  Noted for its stopping power, "
"the .45 ACP round has been common for almost 150 years."
msgstr ""
"Es munición .45 ACP FMJ de 230gr. Conocida por su potencia de detención, la "
"bala .45 ACP ha sido utilizada por casi 150 años."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ".45 Colt JHP"
msgstr ".45 Colt JHP"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ".45 Colt JHP, reloaded"
msgstr ".45 Colt JHP, recargada"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '.45 Colt JHP'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".45 Colt ammunition with 250gr jacketed hollow point bullets.  Originally "
"designed for the Colt Single Action Army, and still used for modern "
"reproduction revolvers.  Originally a black powder cartridge, modern loads "
"can make this round competitive in the new era."
msgstr ""
"Es munición .45 Colt con punta hueca recubierta de 250gr. Originalmente "
"diseñada para la Colt Single Action Army, todavía es utilizada en los "
"revólveres modernos. Originalmente, era un cartucho de pólvora, las cargas "
"modernas pueden hacer que esta munición sea útil."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ".45 FMJ, reloaded"
msgstr ".45 FMJ, recargada"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ".45-70 +P penetrator"
msgstr ".45-70 +P perforante"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ".45-70 +P penetrator, reloaded"
msgstr ".45-70 +P perforante, recargada"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '.45-70 +P penetrator'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".45-70 Government +P ammunition loaded with a 305 grain solid copper "
"penetrator projectile.  Designed for maximum penetration through thick hide "
"and bone while maintaining ideal wounding characteristics."
msgstr ""
"Es munición .45-70 Government +P cargada con un proyectil perforante sólido "
"de cobre de 305 granos. Diseñada para maximizar la penetración de pellejo y "
"hueso manteniendo las características ideales para herir."

#. ~ Description for {'str': '.45-70 +P penetrator, reloaded'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".45-70 Government +P ammunition loaded with a 305 grain solid copper "
"penetrator projectile.  Designed for maximum penetration through thick hide "
"and bone while maintaining ideal wounding characteristics.  This one has "
"been hand-loaded."
msgstr ""
"Es munición .45-70 Government +P cargada con un proyectil perforante sólido "
"de cobre de 305 granos. Diseñada para maximizar la penetración de pellejo y "
"hueso manteniendo las características ideales para herir. Esta ha sido "
"recargada a mano."

#. ~ Description for {'str': '.45-70 SP'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".45-70 Government ammunition loaded with a 305 grain soft point round.  One "
"of the oldest cartridges still in use, it is still a favorite for large game "
"hunting at short ranges."
msgstr ""
"La munición .45-70 Government está cargada con bala de punta suave de 305 "
"granos. Es uno de los cartuchos más antiguos que todavía se utilizan, es el "
"favorito para caza mayor a corta distancia."

#. ~ Description for {'str': '.45-70 SP, reloaded'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".45-70 Government ammunition loaded with a 305 grain soft point round.  One "
"of the oldest cartridges still in use, it is still a favorite for large game "
"hunting at short ranges.  This one has been hand-loaded."
msgstr ""
"La munición .45-70 Government está cargada con bala de punta suave de 305 "
"granos. Es uno de los cartuchos más antiguos que todavía se utilizan, es el "
"favorito para caza mayor a corta distancia. Esta ha sido recargada a mano."

#. ~ Description for {'str': '.45-70 LFN cowboy'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".45-70 Government ammunition loaded with a 405 grain lead flat nose bullet "
"to original specifications for safe use in antique firearms.  Quite a bit "
"less powerful than modern ammo, but still packs a punch."
msgstr ""
"Es munición .45-70 Government cargada con plomo de 405 granos de punta "
"chata, para uso seguro en armas antiguas. Es un poco menos potente que la "
"munición moderna, pero igual tiene potencia."

