#. ~ Description for {'str': '7.62x39mm 57-N-231'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"7.62x39mm 57-N-231 ammunition with 121.9gr steel core FMJ bullets.  "
"Developed in WW2 by the Soviet Union the 7.62x39mm round rapidly became "
"extremely popular all over the world.  The bullet has poor wounding "
"potential due to its stability, only beginning to yaw after 26cm."
msgstr ""
"Es munición 7.62x39mm 57-N-231 con núcleo de acero de 121,9gr, FMJ. "
"Desarrollada en la Segunda Guerra Mundial por la Unión Soviética, la bala "
"7.62x39mm rápidamente se volvió muy usada en todo el mundo. Tiene poco "
"potencial de daño debido a su estabilidad, y solo comienza a cabecear luego "
"de 26cm."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "7.62x39mm M43, reloaded"
msgstr "7.62x39mm M43, recargada"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "7.62x39mm M67"
msgstr "7.62x39mm M67"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '7.62x39mm M67'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"7.62x39mm M67 rounds with 123gr bullets.  The inadequate terminal ballistics "
"of the M43 round led to the development of the M67 round in Yugoslavia in "
"the 1960s.  It destabilizes much faster than M43 after hitting a target "
"leading to greater damage."
msgstr ""
"Son balas 7.62x39mm M67 de 123gr. La inadecuada balística terminal de la "
"bala M43 llevó al desarrollo de la bala M67 en Yugoslavia en los años 60. Se "
"desestabiliza mucho más rápido que la M43 luego de haber golpeado el "
"objetivo, lo que causa mayor daño."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "7.62x39mm M67, reloaded"
msgstr "7.62x39mm M67, recargada"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '7.62x39mm M43, reloaded'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"7.62x39mm ammunition with 121.9gr bullets.  Developed in WW2 by the Soviet "
"Union the 7.62x39mm round rapidly became extremely popular all over the "
"world.  The bullet has poor wounding potential due to its stability, only "
"beginning to yaw after 26cm."
msgstr ""
"Es munición 7.62x39mm con núcleo de acero de 121.9gr. Desarrollada en la "
"Segunda Guerra Mundial por la Unión Soviética, la bala 7.62x39mm rápidamente "
"se volvió muy usada en todo el mundo. Tiene poco potencial de daño debido a "
"su estabilidad, y solo comienza a cabecear luego de 26cm."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "7.62x51mm M80"
msgstr "7.62x51mm M80"

