msgid "8x40mm caseless"
msgstr "8x40mm sin casquillo"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '8x40mm tracer'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"8x40mm caseless rounds with tracers to help keep the weapon they are fired "
"from on target at the risk of igniting flammable substances.  Military grade "
"ammunition for Rivtech firearms.  Being caseless rounds, these cannot be "
"disassembled or reloaded."
msgstr ""
"Son balas sin casquillo 8x40mm y trazadoras para ayudar a mantener apuntada "
"el arma, pero con riesgo de incendiar las sustancias inflamables. Es "
"munición de grado militar para armas Rivtech. Al no tener casquillo, no "
"pueden ser desarmadas ni recargadas."

#. ~ Description for {'str': '8x40mm FMJ'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"8x40mm caseless rounds, full metal jacket.  Military grade ammunition for "
"Rivtech firearms.  Being caseless rounds, these cannot be disassembled or "
"reloaded."
msgstr ""
"Son balas 8x40mm sin casquillo, recubiertas de latón. Son la versión militar "
"de la munición para las armas Rivtech. Al no tener casquillo, no pueden ser "
"desarmadas ni recargadas."

#. ~ Description for {'str': '8x40mm JHP'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"8x40mm caseless rounds, jacketed hollowpoint.  Military grade ammunition for "
"Rivtech firearms.  Being caseless rounds, these cannot be disassembled or "
"reloaded."
msgstr ""
"Son balas 8x40mm sin casquillo, de punta cóncava y recubiertas de latón. "
"Versión militar de la munición para armas Rivtech. Al no tener casquillo, no "
"pueden ser desarmadas ni recargadas."

#. ~ Description for {'str': '8x40mm sporting'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"8x40mm caseless rounds, light sporting load sold for civilian use.  "
"Proprietary ammunition for Rivtech firearms.  Being caseless rounds, these "
"cannot be disassembled or reloaded."
msgstr ""
"Son balas 8x40mm sin casquillo, de carga deportiva ligera para uso civil. "
"Munición exclusiva para armas Rivtech. Al no tener casquillo, no pueden ser "
"desarmadas ni recargadas."

#. ~ Description for {'str': '8x40mm HVP'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"8x40mm caseless rounds, saboted high-velocity penetrator type.  Advanced "
"military grade, armor-piercing ammunition that fires a single depleted "
"uranium flechette.  Being caseless rounds, these cannot be disassembled or "
"reloaded."
msgstr ""
"Balas 8x40mm sin casquillo, tipo sabot perforante de alta velocidad. Versión "
"militar con penetración de blindaje, dispara un dardo de uranio empobrecido. "
"Al no tener casquillo, no pueden ser desarmadas ni recargadas."

#. ~ Description for {'str': '8x40mm caseless'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"8x40mm caseless rounds.  Proprietary ammunition for Rivtech firearms.  Being "
"caseless rounds, these cannot be disassembled or reloaded."
msgstr ""
"Son balas 8x40mm sin casquillo. Es munición exclusiva para armas Rivtech. Al "
"no tener casquillo, no pueden ser desarmadas ni recargadas."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "8x40mm sporting"
msgstr "8x40mm deportivas"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "8x40mm tracer"
msgstr "8x40mm trazadoras"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'PG-7VL 93mm rocket'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "93mm single-stage high-explosive ammunition for the RPG-7."
msgstr "Es munición 93mm monoetapa de alta explosividad para el RPG-7."

#. ~ Description for {'str': '9x18mm, reloaded'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"9x18 millimeter Makarov, an old Soviet pistol cartridge used mainly by the "
"Makarov PM.  As the designation implies, it is a bit shorter in case length "
"compared to 9mm Parabellum.  This one has been hand-reloaded."
msgstr ""
"Makarov de 9x18 milímetros, un viejo cartucho de pistola soviético usado "
"mayormente con el Makarov PM. Como sugiere su designación, su casquillo es "
"un poco más corto que el 9mm Parabellum. Esta ha sido recargada a mano."

#. ~ Description for {'str': '9x18mm FMJ, reloaded'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"9x18 millimeter Makarov, an old Soviet pistol cartridge used mainly by the "
"Makarov PM.  This brass-jacketed round increases penetration slightly, at "
"the cost of reduced expansion.  This one has been hand-reloaded."
msgstr ""
"Makarov de 9x18 milímetros, un viejo cartucho de pistola soviético usado "
"mayormente con el Makarov PM. Esta bala recubierta de latón incrementa un "
"poco su penetración, a cambio de una menor expansión.  Esta ha sido "
"recargada a mano."

#. ~ Description for {'str': '9x18mm +P+, reloaded'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"9x18 millimeter Makarov, an old Soviet pistol cartridge used mainly by the "
"Makarov PM.  This one has been hand-reloaded to generate higher internal "
"pressure, boosting flight stability and damage."
msgstr ""
"Makarov de 9x19 milímetros, un viejo cartucho soviético de pistola utilizado "
"mayormente con el Makarov PM. Esta ha sido recargada a mano para generar una "
"mayor presión interna, lo que incrementa su estabilidad y daño."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "9x18mm +P+, reloaded"
msgstr "9x18mm +P+, recargada"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "9x18mm 57-N-181S"
msgstr "9x18mm 57-N-181S"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
