#. ~ Description for leech flower
#: lang/json/COMESTIBLE_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The alien beauty of this indigo flower is betrayed by its disgustingly "
"fleshy composition.  What from afar appear to be petals are but layered "
"membranes of transparent veiny flesh, given color by a covering of blue "
"iridescent ichor.  Even if it is certainly poisonous, it has a pleasant "
"medicinal smell to it."
msgstr ""

