#. ~ Description for {'str_pl': 'harmonicas with holders', 'str': 'harmonica with a holder'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A harmonica with a holder, so that you can play it without a free hand."
msgstr ""
"Es una armónica con un soporte, así podés tocarla y mantener tus manos "
"libres, como León Gieco."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric blanket'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A heated blanket made of polyester.  The most comfortable thing on Earth.  "
"Its cost is usually negligible, but with the power out, it chews through "
"batteries insanely quickly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric blanket (on)', 'str_pl': 'electric blankets (on)'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A heated blanket made of polyster.  It's turned on, making it nice and "
"toasty while it lasts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'riot helmet'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A helmet with a plastic shield that covers your entire face.  Activate to "
"raise the face shield."
msgstr ""
"Es un casco con una protección plástica que cubre la cara entera. Hay que "
"usarlo para levantar el visor protector."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fedora'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A high-crowned, wide-brimmed, sable colored fedora.  Its brim helps keep the "
"sun out of your eyes.  The perfect hat for treasure hunting."
msgstr ""
"Un fedora de copa alta, ala ancha y color negro. Su ala bloquea los rayos "
"del sol en tus ojos. El sombrero perfecto para ir a cazar tesoros. También "
"se lo conoce con el nombre de borsalino."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'greater bracer of lightning', 'str_pl': 'greater bracers of lightning'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A light but extremely sturdy steel bracer with an ornate bundle of lightning "
"bolts engraved on the top, gold accentuates the intricate design.  It "
"protects your body with a strong aura to reduce electrical damage you take, "
"as well as being able to release a Lightning Bolt spell 3 times a day."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lesser bracer of lightning', 'str_pl': 'lesser bracers of lightning'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A light but extremely sturdy steel bracer with an ornate bundle of lightning "
"bolts engraved on the top, silver accentuates the intricate design.  It "
"protects your body with a light aura to reduce electrical damage you take, "
"as well as being able to release a Jolt spell 3 times a day."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bracer of greater defense', 'str_pl': 'bracers of greater defense'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A light but extremely sturdy steel bracer with an ornate shield engraved on "
"the top, gold accentuates the intricate design.  It protects your body with "
"a strong aura to reduce damage you take."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bracer of lesser defense', 'str_pl': 'bracers of lesser defense'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A light but extremely sturdy steel bracer with an ornate shield engraved on "
"the top, silver accentuates the intricate design.  It protects your body "
"with a light aura to reduce damage you take."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'unfolded poncho'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A lightweight plastic rain poncho with a hood.  Use it to fold for storage."
msgstr ""
"Un poncho ligero de plástico para la lluvia, con capucha. Usalo para "
"doblarlo y que sea más fácil de guardar."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fur scarf', 'str_pl': 'fur scarves'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A long fur scarf, worn over the mouth for warmth.  Use it to loosen it if "
"you get too warm."
msgstr ""
"Una larga bufanda de piel, que se pone sobre la boca para abrigarte. Usala "
"para aflojarla si estás demasiado abrigado."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fur scarf (loose)', 'str_pl': 'fur scarves (loose)'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A long fur scarf, worn over the mouth for warmth.  Use it to wear it tighter "
"if you get too cold."
msgstr ""
"Una larga bufanda de piel, que se pone sobre la boca para abrigarte. Usala "
"para ajustarla si tenés frío."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'knit scarf', 'str_pl': 'knit scarves'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A long knitted cotton scarf, worn over the mouth for warmth.  Use it to "
"loosen it if you get too warm."
msgstr ""
"Es una larga bufanda tejida de algodón que se pone sobre la boca para "
"abrigarte. Usala para aflojarla si estás demasiado abrigado."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'knit scarf (loose)', 'str_pl': 'knit scarves (loose)'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
