msgstr ""
"Es un casco antidisturbio con el cobertor facial levantado. Hay que usarlo "
"para bajar el visor."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ring of protection +4', 'str_pl': 'rings of protection +4'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A silver ring that appreciably reduces some of the force of damage you take "
"when you wear it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ring of speed +5', 'str_pl': 'rings of speed +5'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A silver ring that makes you a good bit faster when you wear it."
