"que lavarla con agua para poder usarla. No te desesperes."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'towel'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a large, sopping wet towel.  If you wait a little bit, it should dry "
"out.  Don't panic."
msgstr ""
"Es una toalla grande, empapada. Si esperás un poco, se va a secar. No te "
"alteres."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stethoscope'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a medical listening tool.  Use it to listen to things.  Closely."
msgstr ""
"Es una herramienta médica para oir. Usalo para escuchar cosas. Más de cerca."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mining helmet (on)', 'str_pl': 'mining helmets (on)'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a mining helmet with a heavy-duty LED flashlight.  The flashlight is "
"turned on, and continually draining its batteries.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mining helmet'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a mining helmet with a heavy-duty LED flashlight.  Using this will "
"turn the flashlight on and provide light, assuming it is charged with "
"batteries."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wearable RX12 jet injector'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a modified RX12 jet injector which can be worn on the body.  A label "
"on the side warns against using more than two doses per hour."
msgstr ""
"Es un inyector de presión RX12 modificado, que puede ser puesto en el "
"cuerpo. Una etiqueta en el costado advierte sobre no usar más de dos dosis "
"por hora."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of thermal electric gloves (on)', 'str_pl': 'pairs of thermal electric gloves (on)'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a pair of gloves with internal battery-powered heating elements.  "
"They are currently on, and continually draining batteries.  Use it to turn "
"them off."
msgstr ""
"Es un par de guantes con resistencias térmicas internas alimentadas con "
"baterías. Ahora están encendidos, consumiendo gradualmente sus baterías. "
"Usalos para apagarlos."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of thermal electric gloves', 'str_pl': 'pairs of thermal electric gloves'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a pair of gloves with internal battery-powered heating elements.  "
"Use it to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"Es un par de guantes con resistencias térmicas internas alimentadas con "
"baterías. Usalos para encenderlos."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of thermal electric socks (on)', 'str_pl': 'pairs of thermal electric socks (on)'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
