"This is a pair of socks with internal battery-powered heating elements.  Use "
"it to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"Es un par de medias con resistencias térmicas internas alimentadas con "
"baterías. Usalo para encenderlas."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift stethoscope'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a relatively cumbersome DIY child's medical listening toy.  Use it "
"to listen to things.  Closely."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'small scuba tank'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'small scuba tank (on)', 'str_pl': 'small scuba tanks (on)'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a small high-pressure 200 bar backup diving tank, that can contain "
"4L of compressed mixture of oxygen and nitrogen.  It is equipped with an on-"
"demand regulator and a mouthpiece designed mostly for underwater use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'thermal electric balaclava (on)', 'str_pl': 'thermal electric balaclavas (on)'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a snug cloth mask with internal battery-powered heating elements.  "
"It is are currently on, and continually draining batteries.  Use it to turn "
"it off."
msgstr ""
"Es un máscara ajustada de lana con resistencias térmicas internas "
"alimentadas con baterías. Ahora está encendido, consumiendo gradualmente sus "
"baterías. Usalo para apagarlo."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'thermal electric balaclava'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a snug cloth mask with internal battery-powered heating elements.  "
"Use it to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"Es un máscara ajustada de lana con resistencias térmicas internas "
"alimentadas con baterías. Usalo para encenderlo."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'UPS', 'str_pl': "UPS's"}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a unified power supply, or UPS.  It is a device developed jointly by "
"military and scientific interests for use in combat and the field.  The UPS "
"is designed to power armor and some guns, but drains batteries quickly.  It "
"can be worn around to either leg for ease of access, and it's been "
"waterproofed to protect the delicate electronics.  Has it's own custom "
"battery, with higher capacity and rechargeable, but not removeable"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'headlamp (on)', 'str_pl': 'headlamps (on)'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is an LED headlamp with an adjustable strap so as to be comfortably "
"worn on your head or attached to your helmet.  It is turned on, and "
"continually draining batteries.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"Es un faro delantero led con una correa ajustable para que sea cómodo de "
"ponerse en la cabeza o en un casco. Ahora está encendido, consumiendo "
"gradualmente sus baterías. Usalo para apagarlo."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'headlamp'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is an LED headlamp with an adjustable strap so as to be comfortably "
"worn on your head or attached to your helmet.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"Es un faro delantero led con una correa ajustable para que sea cómodo de "
"ponerse en la cabeza o en un casco. Usalo para encenderlo."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'advanced UPS', 'str_pl': "advanced UPS's"}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is an advanced version of the unified power supply, or UPS.  This "
"device has been significantly redesigned to provide better efficiency as "
"well as to consume plutonium fuel cells rather than batteries, and is both "
"slimmer and lighter to wear.  Sadly, its plutonium reactor can't be charged "
"in UPS charging station."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'CRIT gasmask (off)', 'str_pl': 'CRIT gasmasks (off)'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is the C.R.I.T Spec Ops modified gasmask, fitted with top-of-the-line "
"electronics and lined with kevlar for extra protection in order to keep "
"one's head where it should be.  Various filters and other high tech wizardry "
"allow for enhanced oxygen intake and safety even under bombardment.  It has "
"an integrated HUD and the option to turn it on for more features."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'CRIT gasmask (on)', 'str_pl': 'CRIT gasmasks (on)'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is the C.R.I.T Spec Ops modified gasmask.  It is currently on and "
"draining power for the HUD, low-level nightvision and other protective "
"elements."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'thermal electric outfit (on)', 'str_pl': 'thermal electric outfits (on)'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This suit of thin thermal underwear covers you from head to toe and is "
"equipped with internal battery-powered heating elements.  It is currently "
"on, and continually draining batteries.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"Es un uniforme de fina ropa interior térmica que te cubre de los pies a la "
"cabeza, y está equipada con resistencias térmicas internas alimentadas con "
"baterías. Está encendido, consumiendo gradualmente sus baterías. Usalo para "
"apagarlo."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'thermal electric outfit'}
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This suit of thin thermal underwear covers you from head to toe and is "
"equipped with internal battery-powered heating elements.  Use it to turn it "
"on."
msgstr ""
"Es un uniforme de fina ropa interior térmica que te cubre de los pies a la "
"cabeza, y está equipada con resistencias térmicas internas alimentadas con "
"baterías. Usalo para encenderlo."

