#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the classic pieces of mad science glassware, this is basically a "
"small volume still that passes the vapour through a fractional distillation "
"column and then condenses the distillate in a cooled collection column.  A "
"grad student or a robot (is there really any difference?) collects the "
"distillate in fractions so that specific contents can be analyzed.  Going a "
"few milliliters at a time, it would not be very effective to try to distill "
"whiskey in this thing."
