"cyborgs fighting in zero-gravity environments."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Silat'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Pentjak Silat, of Indonesian origin, is a fighting style that covers the use "
"of short blades and bludgeons.  Fighters stay low and mobile to avoid "
"attacks, then unleash deadly critical hits."
msgstr ""
"El Pentjak Silat, originario de Indonesia, es un estilo de combate que usa "
"armas blancas cortas y mazas. Los luchadores se mantienen agachados y "
"moviéndose para evitar los ataques, y luego sueltan golpes mortales."

