#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Jittery'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"During moments of great stress or under the effects of stimulants, you may "
"find your hands shaking uncontrollably, severely reducing your Dexterity."
msgstr ""
"En los momentos de mucho estrés o bajo los efectos de estimulantes, vas a "
"ver que tus manos tiemblan incontrolablemente, lo que reduce severamente tu "
"Destreza."

