#. ~ Profession (female Computer Hacker) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Caffeine pills and all-nighters in front of a computer screen have given you "
"skills in an area that seem, on the face of it, distinctly less-than-useful "
"when the world has ended.  Unless you manage to find a military mainframe."
msgstr ""
"Las pastillas de cafeína y las trasnochadas adelante del monitor de tu "
"computadora han elevado tus habilidades en esa área que, a primera vista, "
"son claramente inútiles ahora que el mundo se terminó. Excepto que puedas "
"encontrar una computadora central militar."

