msgid ""
"During the riots a military robot came out of nowhere to rescue you.  Maybe "
"it thinks you're someone important, who knows."
msgstr ""
"Durante los disturbios, un robot militar salió de la nada a rescatarte. Tal "
"vez piense que sos alguien importante, quién sabe."

