msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Through a series of painful and expensive surgeries you became a walking "
"bionic weapon, your services as a mercenary available to the highest "
"bidder.  Now that the world has ended, those bionic enhancements may spell "
"the difference between life and death."
msgstr ""
"A través de una serie de cirugías caras y dolorosas, te convertiste en un "
"arma biónica ambulante. Tus servicios como mercenaria estaban disponibles al "
"mejor postor. Ahora que el mundo se terminó, esas mejoras biónicas pueden "
"ser la diferencia entre la vida y la muerte."

