#. ~ Description for scenario 'The Sweet Life' for a female character.
#: lang/json/scenario_from_json.py
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You open your eyes as if for the first time, looking at yourself you can see "
"your skin gleam in the light.  One word come to your mind \"sugar\" you "
"don't remember where you learned it, in fact you don't remember anything.  "
"You don't know why but you feel hopeful, everything feels new and you're "
"going to make the best of it!"
msgstr ""

