#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Blood…  Delicious."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Cake and grief counseling will be available at the conclusion of the test."
msgstr ""
"Al finalizar el test, tendrá a su disposición un pedazo de torta y un "
"terapeuta."

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Despite your violent behavior, the only thing you've managed to break so far "
"is my heart."
msgstr ""
"A pesar de su conducta violenta, la única cosa que ha logrado romper hasta "
"ahora es mi corazón."

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Die for me!"
msgstr "¡Quiero que mueras por mí!"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Do you really need that much honey?"
msgstr "¿De verdad necesitás toda esa plata?"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Down here, they ALL float!"
msgstr "Acá abajo, ¡flotan TODOS!"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "FUCK YOU!"
msgstr "¡ANDATE A LA MIERDA!"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Fantastic!  You remained resolute and resourceful in an atmosphere of "
"extreme pessimism."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"For your own safety and the safety of others, please refrain from touching "
"[bzzzzzt]"
msgstr ""
"Por su propia seguridad y la seguridad de los demás, por favor evite tocar "
"[bzzzzzt]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Go kill yourself!"
msgstr "¡Por qué no te matás!"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Good job on that, by the way.  SARCASM SPHERE SELF-TEST COMPLETE."
msgstr ""
"Buen trabajo con eso, la verdad. AUTO-PRUEBA DE ÁMBITO DE SARCASMO "
"COMPLETADA."

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Good people don't end up here."
msgstr "Las buenas personas no terminan aquí adentro."

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Heehee!"
msgstr "¡Heehee!"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Hello again.  To reiterate our previous warning: [garbled]"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Hey kids.  Want some candy?"
msgstr "Hola, chicos. ¿Quieren un caramelo?"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I don't want to tell you your business, but if it were me, I'd leave that "
"thing alone."
msgstr ""
"No le quiero decir lo que tiene que hacer, pero si fuera yo, no me metería "
"con esa cosa."

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "I hate you."
msgstr "Te odio."

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I have an infinite capacity for knowledge, and even I'm not sure what's "
"going on outside."
msgstr ""
"Tengo una infinita capacidad de conocimiento, e incluso yo no puedo estar "
"seguro de lo que sucede afuera."

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I know you don't believe this, but everything that has happened so far was "
"for your benefit."
msgstr ""
"Sé que no me cree, pero todo lo que sucedió hasta ahora fue en su propio "
"beneficio."

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "I know you're there.  I can feel you here."
msgstr "Ya sé que está ahí. Lo puedo sentir ahí."

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I'd just like to point out that you were given every opportunity to succeed."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I'm checking some blueprints, and I think…  Yes, right here.  You're "
"definitely going the wrong way."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "If you become light headed from thirst, feel free to pass out."
msgstr ""
"Si se siente un poco mareado por la sed, dele tranquilo y desmáyese nomás."

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "It's not too late to turn back."
msgstr "No es demasiado tarde para volver atrás."

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Let's be honest: Neither one of us knows what that thing does.  Just put it "
