msgstr ""

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Sure.  My grandparents were from China.  That means I'm obviously personally "
"responsible for all this.  Do you think there's some other reason they let "
"hundreds of other educated people in and I'm sitting out here?"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Sure…"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "Take your time, aim carefully."
msgstr "Tomate tu tiempo, apuntá con cuidado."

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Tax evasion.  I was an accountant, and I helped my boss move a hell of a lot "
