#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You are dragged behind the %s!"
msgstr "¡Sos arrastrado atrás del %s!"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"You are under arrest, citizen.  You have the right to remain silent.  If you "
"do not remain silent, anything you say may be used against you in a court of "
"law."
msgstr ""
"Está bajo arresto, ciudadano. Tiene el derecho de permanecer en silencio. Si "
"no permanece en silencio, todo lo que diga podrá ser usado en su contra en "
"la corte."

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"You deftly slip out of the handcuffs just as the robot closes them.  The "
"robot didn't seem to notice!"
msgstr ""
"Hábilmente, te escapás de las esposas justo cuando el robot las cerraba. ¡El "
"robot parece no haberse dado cuenta!"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "You dodge it!"
msgstr "¡Lo esquivaste!"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "You dodge the beam!"
msgstr "¡Esquivás el rayo!"

