msgid "You evade the stretched arm and it sails past you!"
msgstr "¡Evadís el brazo extendido y te pasa cerca!"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"You fall to the ground and feign a sudden convulsive attack.  Though you're "
"obviously still alive, the riotbot cannot tell the difference between your "
"'attack' and a potentially fatal medical condition.  It backs off, signaling "
"for medical help."
msgstr ""
"Te tirás al piso y fingís un repentino ataque de convulsiones. Aunque "
"obviamente todavía estás vivo, el antidisturbot no puede notar la diferencia "
"entre tu 'ataque' y un potencial condición médica fatal. Se retira, buscando "
"ayuda médica."

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "You feel a strange reverberation across your body."
msgstr ""

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "You feel like you're being watched, it makes you sick."
msgstr "Sentís como si te estuvieran mirando, y te hace sentir mal."

