#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "\"Huh?  What was that?\""
msgstr "\"¿Eh? ¿Qué fue eso?\""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "\"I think it's starting to kick in.\""
msgstr "\"Creo que está empezando a hacer efecto.\""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "\"Of course… it's all fractals!\""
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "\"Oh God, what's happening?\""
msgstr "\"Oh Dios, ¿qué está pasando?\""

#. ~ 1$s is NPC name, 2$s is bodypart in accusative.
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s starts scratching their %2$s!"
msgstr "¡%1$s se está rascando su %2$s!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "<npcname> loses some blood."
msgstr "<npcname> pierde un poco de sangre."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "<npcname> vomits a thick, gray goop."
msgstr "<npcname> vomita algo como grasa gris espesa."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "<npcname> vomits thousands of live spores!"
msgstr "¡<npcname> vomita cientas de esporas vivas!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "<npcname>'s arms bulge.  Fungus stalks burst out of the bulges!"
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "<npcname>'s broken arms bulge.  Fungus stalks burst out of the bulges!"
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "<npcname>'s hands bulge.  Fungus stalks burst through the bulge!"
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "A monster appears nearby!"
msgstr "¡Aparece un monstruo cerca!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "A portal opens nearby, and a monster crawls through!"
msgstr "¡Un portal se abre cerca, y un monstruo aparece arrastrándose!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Dancing fractals distract you."
msgstr "Fractales danzantes te distraen."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Everything around you is starting to breathe."
msgstr "Todo empieza a respirar alrededor tuyo."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Everything looks SO boring now."
msgstr "Ahora todo parece MUY aburrido."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Fractal patterns dance across your vision."
msgstr "Adelante de tus ojos, comienzan a bailar estructuras fractales."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Glowing lights surround you, and you teleport."
msgstr "Te rodean luces brillantes, y te teletransportás."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "However, you manage to keep hold of your weapon."
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "However, you manage to keep your footing."
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Insects begin to emerge from <npcname>'s skin!"
msgstr "¡Insectos empiezan a brotar de la piel de <npcname>!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "It looks like you woke up just before your alarm."
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "It's some kind of electric snake, coming right at you!"
msgstr "Es como una serpiente eléctrica, ¡que viene hacia vos!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "It's too bright to sleep."
msgstr "Hay mucha luz para dormir."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "It's too cold to sleep."
msgstr "Hace demasiado frío para dormir."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "It's too hot to sleep."
msgstr "Hace demasiado calor para dormir."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "No one should be asked to handle this trip."
msgstr "No se le tendría que pedir a nadie que haga este viaje."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid ""
"Order us some golf shoes, otherwise we'll never get out of this place alive."
msgstr ""
"Pedinos unas zapatos para golf, de lo contrario nunca saldremos de acá con "
"vida."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Something feels very, very wrong."
msgstr "Algo parece estar mal, muy mal."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "The bees have started escaping your teeth."
msgstr "Las abejas empezaron a escaparse de tus dientes."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid ""
"The flesh on your broken and unbroken arms bulge.  Fungus stalks burst "
"through!"
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "The flesh on your broken arms bulges.  Fungus stalks burst through!"
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "The heat is making you see things."
msgstr "El calor te está haciendo ver cosas."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "The possibility of physical and mental collapse is now very real."
msgstr "Ahora te parece muy real la posibilidad del colapso físico y mental."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "The world takes on a dreamlike quality."
msgstr "El mundo adopta una similitud a los sueños."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "There's some kind of big machine in the sky."
msgstr "Hay una especie de máquina grande en el cielo."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Things are returning to normal."
msgstr "Las cosas vuelven a la normalidad."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "We have many colonists awaiting passage."
msgstr "Tenemos muchos colonos esperando un pasaje."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Why waste your time on that insignificant speck?"
msgstr "¿Para qué vas a gastar tiempo en esa mancha insignificante?"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You are beset with a vision of a prowling beast."
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You are sweating profusely."
msgstr "Estás transpirando como testigo falso."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid ""
"You dissolve into beautiful paroxysms of energy.  Life fades from your "
"nebulae and you are no more."
msgstr ""
"Te disolvés en hermosos paroxismos de energía. La vida se desvanece de tu "
"nebulosa y ya no existís más."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You feel a little strange."
msgstr "Te sentís un poco extraño."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid ""
"You feel like you need less teeth.  You pull one out, and it is rotten to "
"the core."
msgstr ""
"Sentís como si necesitaras menos dientes. Te sacás uno, y está podrido desde "
"la raíz."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You feel nauseous!"
msgstr "¡Te sentís con náuseas!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You feel nauseous."
msgstr "Sentís náuseas."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You feel paranoid.  They're watching you."
msgstr "Te sentís paranoico. Te están observando."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid ""
"You feel physically rested, but you haven't been able to catch up on your "
"missed sleep yet."
msgstr ""
"Te sentís físicamente descansado, pero no pudiste recuperar el tiempo de "
"sueño perdido."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You feel sick to your stomach."
msgstr "Te sentís mal del estómago."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid ""
"You feel so sick, like you've been poisoned, but you need more.  So much "
"more."
msgstr ""
"Te sentís muy enfermo, como si hubieras sido envenenado, pero necesitás más. "
"Mucho más."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You feel well rested."
msgstr "Te sentís bien descansado."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You have a splitting headache."
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You have a sudden nostalgic feeling."
msgstr "De repente, te agarra un sentimiento de nostalgia."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You have trouble grasping with your numb fingers."
msgstr "Te cuesta agarrar cosas con los dedos dormidos."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You lose consciousness!"
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You lose control of your body as it begins to convulse!"
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You lose some blood."
msgstr "Perdés un poco de sangre."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You notice a large abscess.  You pick at it."
msgstr "Te encontraste un absceso grande. Lo pellizcás."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You pass out."
msgstr "Te desmayaste."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You quiver from the cold."
msgstr "Estás temblando de frío."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You see %s approaching!"
msgstr "¡Ves %s acercándose! "

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You shudder suddenly."
msgstr "De repente, sentís un escalofrío."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You smell and taste mushrooms."
msgstr "Sentís olor y sabor a hongos."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You spasm suddenly!"
msgstr "¡De repente, tenés un espasmo!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You stagger and fall!"
msgstr "¡Te tambaleás y te caés!"

#. ~ %s is bodypart in accusative.
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You start scratching your %s!"
msgstr "¡Te rascás tu %s!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You succumb to the infection."
msgstr "Sucumbís a la infección."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You suddenly lose all muscle tone, and can't support your own weight!"
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You toss and turn in the heat."
msgstr "Das vueltas del calor."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You toss and turn trying to keep warm."
msgstr "Das vueltas tratando de mantener la temperatura."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You vomit a thick, gray goop."
msgstr "Vomitás algo como grasa gris espesa."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You vomit thousands of live spores!"
msgstr "¡Vomitás cientas de esporas vivas!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You wheeze and gasp for air."
msgstr "Resoplás y jadeás intentando respirar."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid ""
"You're experiencing loss of basic motor skills and blurred vision.  Your "
"mind recoils in horror, unable to communicate with your spinal column."
msgstr ""
"Estás sintiendo una pérdida de tus habilidades motoras básicas, y visión "
"borrosa. Tu mente retrocede espantada, incapaz de comunicarse con tu columna "
"vertebral."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You're suddenly covered in ectoplasm."
msgstr "De repente, estás cubierto de ectoplasma."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s suddenly jerks in an unexpected direction!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ %s is bodypart name.
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s wound begins to feel better!"
msgstr "¡La herida en tu %s empieza a sentirse mejor!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your alarm is going off."
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your alarm went off."
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your asthma attack stops."
msgstr "Dejás de tener un ataque de asma."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid ""
"Your asthma overcomes you.\n"
"You asphyxiate."
msgstr ""
"Tu asma se vuelve incontrolable.\n"
"Te asfixiaste."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your bowels ache."
msgstr "Te duelen los intestinos."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your face feels numb."
msgstr "Sentís la cara adormecida."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your face is stiff from the cold."
msgstr "Tenés la cara dura de frío."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your flesh crawls; insects tear through the flesh and begin to emerge!"
msgstr ""
"Tu carne está plagada de bichos. ¡Insectos desgarran tu piel y empiezan a "
"brotar!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your foot has gone numb."
msgstr "Se te durmió el pie."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your freezing left foot messes up your balance."
msgstr "Perdés un poco el balance por tener el pie izquierdo helado."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your freezing right foot messes up your balance."
msgstr "Perdés un poco el balance por tener el pie derecho helado."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your hands bulge.  Fungus stalks burst through the bulge!"
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your head aches faintly."
msgstr "Te duele ligeramente la cabeza."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your head is pounding from the heat."
msgstr "Sentís un martilleo en tu cabeza debido al calor."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid ""
"Your heart spasms painfully and stops, dragging you back to reality as you "
"die."
msgstr ""
"Sentís espasmos dolorosos en tu corazón, y se detiene, arrastrándote hacia "
